                                "sense_id": "1e5466c2-5203-3bc4-849d-4b1317995075",
                                "text": "Tracing their battles, I had many occasions to walk along Second Avenue, the aorta of the Lower East Side, exploring places that were once as vibrant and tumultuous as Midtown Manhattan."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
